WEBVTT

00:00:00.453 --> 00:00:02.945
The Magistrate's blank law breaks. Stolen names return.

00:00:03.625 --> 00:00:06.570
Every recovered voice gathers around one surviving will.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:10.648
Liora: Aren. Look at me. I chose the division.

00:00:11.328 --> 00:00:14.727
Liora: You mapped ten paths because I asked you
to keep my testimony from Serath.

00:00:15.406 --> 00:00:18.352
Liora: The choice was mine. The design—and its cost—were ours.

00:00:19.031 --> 00:00:21.977
Serath: Cartographer. Two paths do not make a kingdom.

00:00:22.656 --> 00:00:25.602
Serath: Bring her closer, and the Engine will finish your map.

00:00:26.281 --> 00:00:28.773
Chapter II complete. Chapter III: The Sundered Aqueduct. Coming soon.
